{"id": "UgyqyAs8eAw77pGQMa54AaABAg", "parent": null, "likes": 0, "text": "동절양채", "published": "2026-10-03T08:43:28", "replies": 0, "creator": false}
{"id": "UgzvEg_3JuzEzjE9ITl4AaABAg", "parent": null, "likes": 1, "text": "왔따메 눈내리는 겨울에 지붕위에 올라가서 덮는다고요.\n겁나게 힘들었겠네요", "published": "2026-10-03T08:05:57", "replies": 0, "creator": false}
